          "text": "Description: Recent testimony (on February 22, 2010) of an older observation (in October 1998) without a precise date. A witness filmed a set of lights moving in the sky. Unfortunately, the original sound heard by the witness has been replaced by music. No other testimony about this phenomenon has been received at that date. The video associated with the testimony and the questionnaire are not exploitable, and any investigation is impossible. The observation is classified as C.",
